    "short_description":  "\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003e24V RGB+CCT LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e, with 12mm width and dual diode technology: \u003cstrong\u003eRGB 3535\u003c/strong\u003e for dynamic multicolor effects and \u003cstrong\u003eCCT 2835\u003c/strong\u003e to adjust white temperature according to environment. Thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003e10-meter roll\u003c/strong\u003e, you can light up large spaces with a single installation. Ideal for decorative, commercial, or residential projects seeking \u003cstrong\u003etotal control of color and light temperature\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
